---
const items = [
  ["Is the plat approved?", "No. The preliminary plat and site development permit were submitted August 5, 2026 and remain under City of Bremerton review. Closing is conditioned on site plan approval."],
  ["Are the homes fee-simple?", "That is the filed design intent. The program uses a unit-lot subdivision for 38 fee-simple attached single-family homes, subject to City review and final conditions."],
  ["What is the frontage-parcel option?", "Parcel 1 is a 17,238-SF General Commercial frontage parcel planned for six homes. The seller will consider its separate disposition from the 32-home balance."],
  ["What are the finished square footages?", "The public plan matrix shows verified building footprints only. Finished floor areas are not stated in the source record; full architectural sheets are available in the data room for buyer verification."],
  ["Is a broker involved?", "No. Laughlin Development LLC owns the property and is offering it directly. Enquiries go to principal Ian Laughlin."],
];
---

<section class="section faq" aria-labelledby="faq-h">
  <div class="shell layout">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Buyer questions</p>
      <h2 id="faq-h" class="display-l">The first five answers.</h2>
      <a class="cta" href="/inquire">Ask the principal →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="items">
      {items.map(([question, answer], i) => (
        <details open={i === 0}>
          <summary>{question}</summary>
          <p>{answer}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .faq { background: var(--paper-2); }
  .layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .75fr 1.25fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 7rem); }
  h2 { max-width: 10ch; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .cta { color: var(--brass-ink); font-size: .75rem; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  details { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); padding: 1.1rem 0; }
  details:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  summary { cursor: pointer; list-style: none; font: 400 1.25rem var(--font-display); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  summary::after { content: "+"; color: var(--brass-ink); }
  details[open] summary::after { content: "−"; }
  details p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; max-width: 66ch; margin: .9rem 0 .2rem; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
